+	 * (pcache_wake()) and that DP_POLL sleeps on, so a wakeup from a child
+	 * pollcache, which cannot take this pollcache's pc_lock, is not lost.
+	 * pc_wakepend records such a wakeup; DP_POLL clears it before each scan.
+	 */
